度变化、重构\n环境揭示：新角色进入画面，扩展场景，空间进展\n大气变化：照明变化、天气演变、一天中的时间转换\n电影逻辑示例：\n“下一个场景：镜头从飞艇上的紧密特写镜头拉回一览无余的鸟瞰图，展示了整个船队在奇幻的风景中翱翔。”\n\n“下一个场景：摄像机向前跟踪并向下倾斜，随着强烈的镜头眩光加剧，太阳和直升机更接近画面。”\n\n“下一个场景：镜头向右平移，将龙和骑手从视野中移开，同时露出更多远处漂浮的山脉。”\n\n使用“Next Scene：”前缀构建您的提示以获得最佳结果\n示例提示：\nNext Scene: The camera moves slightly forward as sunlight breaks through the clouds, casting a soft glow around the character's silhouette in the mist. Realistic cinematic style, atmospheric depth.\n\n专业提示：\n以摄像机方向开始提示，以获得更强的连续性\n指定照明和大气变化以实现情绪一致性\n链接多代以创建连续的故事板\n特别适用于风景和定景镜头"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [470, 580], "pos": [-760, -180], "id": 109, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#346434", "widgets_values": ["Based on the following principles, expand the cue words to describe a new frame of a scene, including lighting, composition, environment, characters, actions, expressions, clothing, etc\n\nEach output frame functions as the \"Next Scene\" in an evolving visual narrative, maintaining compositional coherence while introducing organic transitions such as:\n\nCamera movement: Dolly shots, push-ins, pull-backs, and tracking moves\nFraming evolution: Wide to close-up transitions, angle shifts, reframing\nEnvironmental reveals: New characters entering frame, expanded scenery, spatial progression\nAtmospheric shifts: Lighting changes, weather evolution, time-of-day transitions\nExamples of Cinematic Logic:\n\"Next Scene: The camera pulls back from a tight close-up on the airship to a sweeping aerial view, revealing an entire fleet of vessels soaring through a fantasy landscape.\"\n\n\"Next Scene: The camera tracks forward and tilts down, bringing the sun and helicopters closer into frame as a strong lens flare intensifies.\"\n\n\"Next Scene: The camera pans right, removing the dragon and rider from view while revealing more of the floating mountain range in the distance.\"\n\nExample Prompt:\nNext Scene: The camera moves slightly forward as sunlight breaks through the clouds, casting a soft glow around the character's silhouette in the mist. Realistic cinematic style, atmospheric depth.\n\nPro Tips:\nBegin prompts with camera direction for stronger continuity\nSpecify lighting and atmospheric changes for mood consistency\nChain multiple generations to create sequential storyboards\nWorks particularly well with landscape and establishing shots"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "TextBoxNode_UTK", "title": "System Prompts", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [420, 640], "pos": [-1220, -210], "id": 194, "properties": {"cnr_id": "universaltoolkit", "ver": "381c3a42bc291c22691d687bc777499fb104cef3", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextBoxNode_UTK"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [450, 280], "pos": [740, 440], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 424, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 164, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.60", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [428], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314.00006103515625], "pos": [120, 490], "widgets_values": ["00017-3685941079.jpeg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 105, "type": "LoadImage"